        "headingId": 703,
        "headingText": "\r\n\r\n<p>2A83.0 &amp; XH16T1 Monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance &amp; IgM monoclonal gammopathy of undetermined significance</p>\r\n\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2024-03-12T11:56:17"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
